he device joins the organization's hosted configuration. Under the organization's hosted configuration it takes sessions from any earlier device configuration (including ones a console sign-in created) but never sessions stored under another organization's hosted configuration; under device-delivered configuration it takes only sessions stored while no organization ID was configured, and only once an organization ID is configured. Turn on `enabled` as well so users can import anything it leaves out by hand. Requires Cowork to run on the host (not in the VM sandbox).",{docsOnly:!1})}}),exportEnabled:Te.subfield(en.z.boolean().default(!1),{label:Oe.msg({defaultMessage:"Enable session export",id:"c4gImpExEn"}),support:{availableInVersion:"1.32352.0"},description:{short:Te.shortDescription(Oe.msg({defaultMessage:"Lets users export this computer\u2019s chats, Cowork tasks, and Code sessions as a zip another install can import. No effect unless `enabled` is true.",id:"c4gImpExSh"}),{docsOnly:!1}),long:Te.longDescription("Allows users to write this computer's chats, Cowork tasks, and Code sessions to a portable zip that another install can import from Settings > Import. Transcripts contain conversation content including tool outputs; only session-record metadata is projected to a fixed field allowlist. Treat exported zips as sensitive data.",{docsOnly:!1})}}),bannerBehavior:Te.subfield(en.z.enum(["off","detect","show"]).optional(),{label:Oe.msg({defaultMessage:"Import prompt banner",id:"c4gImpBnr0"}),support:{availableInVersion:"1.28929.0"},description:{short:Te.shortDescription(Oe.msg({defaultMessage:"Prompt to import at the top of a new chat or task. `detect`: only when earlier Claude sessions are found on this computer. `show`: always. Hidden when unset.",id:"k+ptrunPTe"}),{docsOnly:!1})}})};BT.PASSTHROUGH_FIELDS={claudeAiImport:Te.field(en.z.object(Ane).refine((e)=>!$ne(e)||Boolean(e.url&&e.oauthIssuer&&e.oauthClientId),{message:"url, oauthIssuer and oauthClientId are 